  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1500.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1507.03 Waiver Request Contents",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1507.03 Waiver Request Contents. The waiver request shall include the following information:\n\n(a) The name, mailing address, email address, and daytime telephone number including area code of the applicant;\n\n(b) The rebate application to which the waiver request relates via the address provided in Env-Dw 1504.02(2) or Env-Dw 1505.02(2);\n\n(c) The number of the specific section(s) of this Chapter to be waived;\n\n(d) A complete explanation of why a waiver request is being submitted, including an explanation of the economic and operational consequences of complying with the rule as written;\n\n(e) If applicable, a full explanation of the alternative(s) proposed to be substituted for the requirement in the rule, including documentation or data, or both, to support the alternative; and\n\n(g) A complete explanation of why the applicant believes that having the waiver granted will meet the criteria in Env-Dw 1507.05.\n\nSource. #14201, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1500.html"
}
